00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:06,180
will be making to decorate the homestead for Christmas. Next week, I'll be coming with some

84
00:10:06,180 --> 00:10:09,540
supplies and we will be making some decorations.

85
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:17,800
You know, when I was a little girl, my mother and father, I was born during the Depression years and we didn't have a lot of money.

86
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:24,820
in fact we had very little and so my mother and father taught me at a very

87
00:10:24,820 --> 00:10:31,900
early age that it isn't how much money you have but it's the goodness and the kindness and the sharing that's

88
00:10:31,900 --> 00:10:38,920
inside of each of us that really counts and I've tried to live that in my life and

89
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:46,560
tried to stay away from always depending upon money as a way of expressing my love and concern for people so

90
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:53,600
when Christmas comes around I prefer to make the things that I give rather than to buy them. Now I know

91
00:10:53,600 --> 00:11:00,720
there are times when you do spend money but I hope that each one of you will try to find some particular thing that

92
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:07,840
