97
00:11:36,980 --> 00:11:44,120
the life of someone else. Because Preston Wolfe has never been here at Christmastime and will not be

98
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:49,380
back to see the building when it's decorated, I made him some samples.

99
00:11:49,460 --> 00:11:52,300
Do you know what a sample is? What is a sample?

100
00:11:52,720 --> 00:12:00,112
CHILD: It looks like something that, like, you made so that you

101
00:12:00,112 --> 00:12:06,540
could show before the other people can't see it.

102
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:13,740
ANN: Right, because he won't be here. Yes. And also, I want you to know that many times

103
00:12:13,740 --> 00:12:20,780
we have people come in that are from other countries. We've had people from Japan, Germany, and France. And I like

104
00:12:20,780 --> 00:12:28,040
