120
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:24,660
and clean, got the dirt nice and smooth. Then you know what she did? She took a stick and she marked a border

121
00:14:24,660 --> 00:14:32,240
around on the dirt, just the way you would find a border on an oriental rug. And

122
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:39,740
that's the way she made her house nice and neat and clean. And then maybe she went out to the spring house and brought in an armful

123
00:14:39,740 --> 00:14:46,920
of mint. You know what mint smells like? Like peppermint. And it's, oh, it's great, isn't

124
00:14:46,920 --> 00:14:54,160
