134
00:15:58,110 --> 00:16:05,410
would come in and kill the settlers and capture their children and take them off as captives and

135
00:16:05,410 --> 00:16:12,570
kill their livestock. It was a very dangerous period in our history. But this Indian, whose name was Peter,

136
00:16:12,790 --> 00:16:20,530
evidently had become a Christian. And he gave up his Indian name and everyone called him Peter,

137
00:16:20,650 --> 00:16:23,250
which is from the Bible, isn't it? Indian Peter.

138
00:16:23,250 --> 00:16:30,470
And instead of killing the settlers he would come and help them to plant their crops

139
00:16:30,470 --> 00:16:38,230
in the spring and harvest them in the fall and if he knew that there were some Indians that were going raiding

140
00:16:38,230 --> 00:16:45,350
in the area you know how the Indian braves used to have hunting parties and they would go out and they would move very fast

141
00:16:45,350 --> 00:16:54,110
and come in and kill the people when he knew that they were in the area he would go and he would knock on the door and

142
00:16:54,110 --> 00:17:01,330
when the settler would open the door he'd say the Indians are coming you must take your family

